{
  "id": "AuronProcUpload1",
  "name": "AURON - Processed Upload",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "auron-processed-upload",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook: /auron-processed-upload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "3a7c1e92-6b40-4f2d-8c11-95d0e7a4b201",
      "notes": "The same upload branch the ingest workflow ends with, on a trigger that can be pulled without opening n8n. `n8n execute --id` runs the ingest workflow but stops silently after the pending-uploads call, so the graded files never left the laptop."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Same secret as the Drive fetch webhook: port 5678 is reachable from\n// the LAN, and this endpoint writes to Drive.\nconst expected = $env.AURON_DRIVE_FETCH_SECRET;\nconst given = (($input.first().json.headers) || {})['x-auron-secret'];\nif (!expected) {\n  throw new Error('AURON_DRIVE_FETCH_SECRET is not set in n8n -- refusing every request');\n}\nif (given !== expected) {\n  throw new Error('wrong or missing X-Auron-Secret');\n}\nreturn [{ json: {} }];"
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Check secret",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 0],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://api:8000/v1/instagram/media-pool/pending-uploads",
        "options": { "timeout": 60000 }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "AURON: Was ist fertig bearbeitet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 0],
      "executeOnce": true,
      "notes": "Fragt AURON, welche bearbeiteten Dateien noch nicht in Drive liegen. Nicht raten: ein Verzeichnis-Listing sagt nicht, zu welchem Item eine Datei gehoert."
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "fieldToSplitOut": "items", "options": {} },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Je Datei",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [660, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "batchSize": 10, "options": {} },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "In Zehnerschritten",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [880, 0],
      "notes": "266 files at once would hold every file in memory at the same time -- the same way five parallel ingests ran the 3.5 GB VM out of it."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fileSelector": "=/data/images/processed/{{ $json.processed_file }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Bearbeitete Datei lesen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1100, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "name": "={{ $('In Zehnerschritten').item.json.processed_file }}",
        "driveId": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "My Drive" },
        "folderId": { "__rl": true, "mode": "id", "value": "1bp_LxsOhQVu_VXlMmnKBwK-HNlFSjBvX" },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Drive: Bearbeitete hochladen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1320, 120],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": { "id": "sVwp500LT1RTHHDT", "name": "Google Drive account" }
      },
      "notes": "Eigener Ordner, NICHT der Quellordner: sonst sieht der naechste Lauf die bearbeitete Datei als neue Datei und analysiert sie erneut."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://api:8000/v1/instagram/media-pool/processed-uploaded",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"items\": $input.all().map((x, i) => ({ media_ref: $('In Zehnerschritten').all()[i].json.media_ref, processed_media_ref: x.json.id })) } }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 60000 }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "AURON: Drive-ID merken",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1540, 120],
      "executeOnce": true,
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "notes": "Ohne diesen Schritt weiss AURON nicht, wo die bearbeitete Datei liegt, und der Post wuerde weiter das Original nehmen. Pro Zehnerbatch, damit ein Abbruch nur den laufenden Batch kostet."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"uploaded\": $('Je Datei').all().length } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Respond: fertig",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [1100, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"error\": $json.error?.message || $json.error || 'refused' } }}",
        "options": { "responseCode": 403 }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Respond: refused",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [440, 200]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook: /auron-processed-upload": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Check secret", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Check secret": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "AURON: Was ist fertig bearbeitet", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Respond: refused", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "AURON: Was ist fertig bearbeitet": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Je Datei", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Je Datei": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "In Zehnerschritten", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "In Zehnerschritten": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Respond: fertig", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Bearbeitete Datei lesen", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Bearbeitete Datei lesen": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Drive: Bearbeitete hochladen", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Drive: Bearbeitete hochladen": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "AURON: Drive-ID merken", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "AURON: Drive-ID merken": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "In Zehnerschritten", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1", "binaryMode": "separate" }
}
